sequenceDiagram
    actor Op as Operator
    participant BF as Bifrost Control
    participant PLplan as Release Planner
    participant MI as Mimir (risk/inference)
    participant AG as Cluster Agent
    participant TGT as Target Environment
    Op->>BF: propose release (artefact + manifest)
    BF->>PLplan: compute rollout plan
    PLplan->>MI: predict risk / anomaly window
    MI-->>PLplan: risk score + guardrails
    PLplan-->>BF: staged plan (canary→prod)
    BF->>AG: apply (signed, ML-DSA)
    AG->>TGT: rolling update (zero-downtime)
    TGT-->>AG: health signals
    AG-->>BF: progress + auto-rollback if breach
    BF-->>Op: status + audit